---
// $ ls -la ./products
---
<section id="products" class="relative border-t border-term-line bg-term-panel/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="reveal text-sm text-term-faint">
      <span class="term-prompt font-bold">supian@octopy</span><span class="text-term-faint">:</span><span class="term-path">~</span><span class="text-term-faint">$</span>
      <span class="text-term-text"> ls -la ./products</span>
    </p>
    <p class="reveal mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-term-faint" style="--reveal-delay: 60ms">
      total 2
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
      <article class="reveal term-window p-6 md:p-8" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <p class="text-lg">
            <span class="text-term-dim">drwxr-xr-x</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-term-cyan"> poka/</span>
          </p>
          <span class="rounded bg-term-green/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-term-green uppercase">flagship</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-term-text/80">
          Offline-first personal finance. Open-core to its bones — the Community Edition lives
          on GitHub under Apache 2.0, and the Premium tier is in Google Play review.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
          <a href="https://getpoka.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-term-green underline decoration-term-green/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-term-text">
            → getpoka.app
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/getpoka/poka-ce" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-term-dim transition-colors hover:text-term-text">
            <i class="ph ph-github-logo"></i> poka-ce
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal term-window p-6 md:p-8" style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <p class="text-lg">
            <span class="text-term-dim">drwxr-xr-x</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-term-cyan"> tako/</span>
          </p>
          <span class="rounded bg-term-line px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-term-dim uppercase">lab</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-term-text/80">
          Self-hosted platform-as-a-service — a Dokploy-style control plane for shipping apps
          on your own servers. The workshop where Octopy&rsquo;s infrastructure ideas earn
          their keep.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 text-sm">
          <a href="https://gettako.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-term-dim transition-colors hover:text-term-text">
            → gettako.dev
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 text-sm text-term-faint" style="--reveal-delay: 240ms">
      <span class="text-term-faint">$</span>
      <a href="/workshop" class="text-term-text underline decoration-term-green/50 underline-offset-4 hover:text-term-green">
        find ./workshop -type f
      </a>
      <span class="text-term-faint"># the full archive →</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
